# EFFIGY-API — generated, do not hand-edit

This file is generated by `effigy.sh api --write` (ApiCatalog, Lane P). 
Hand edits are overwritten on the next regeneration; fix the kernel or 
ApiCatalog instead, then regenerate. `effigy.sh api --check` fails if 
any feature, verb, preset or CLI command below is missing from this file.

## Features (96)

